  "name": "Chocolate Rocky Road Cake",
  "subtitle": "A rich chocolate cake finished with a crisp, chewy rocky-road topping.",
  "description": "Bake a moist chocolate cake, cool it, then cover it with melted chocolate, biscuits, marshmallows, and assorted treats before chilling until set.",
